    {
      "id": 10,
      "label": "text",
      "content": "Although REAL's spending in 1977 was at a significantly high rate versus previous RJR new brand introductions, its impact was somewhat diluted by the national introduction of 19 competitive new brand items (all low \"tar\") during the year. Importantly, Merit's first year expenditures accounted for a greater share of both low \"tar\" category and new brand expenditures than did REAL's.",
